//! The default character inventory, generated from a GWPS trace. DO NOT EDIT BY HAND.
//!
//! Generated by `tools/gen-default-inventory.py` from a full-byte trace of the
//! reference (`GWPS_TRACE=1`) working: the `CREATE_NAMED_ITEM`, `INVENTORY_CREATE_BAG`,
//! `ITEM_MOVED_TO_LOCATION` and `ITEM_SET_PROFESSION` messages it sends for the character
//! it loads. 29 messages.
//!
//! Why copy rather than invent: a client given no items has no inventory model and dies
//! when it draws the character it has just created. These are the reference's own items,
//! with its own ids and file ids, so the wire is identical to what a working server
//! sends. When this project has an item system these become rows in a table; the ids
//! below are the ones the capture used, kept here so that can be checked.
//!
//! Regenerate with `python tools/gen-default-inventory.py --capture <trace>`; verify with
//! `--check`.

